# NAME: AI-Challenge
# DESC: Cloudflare Turnstile / challenge + Arkose used by ChatGPT, Claude, etc.
# NOTE: Assign the SAME policy as your AI rules (e.g. 美国手动策略).
#       Do NOT route all of cloudflare.com here.
# UPDATED: 2026-09-04

# Cloudflare Turnstile / Challenge Platform
DOMAIN,challenges.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,challenges.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,challenge.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,challenge.cloudflare.com

# Cloudflare insights / challenge assets commonly loaded on AI sites
DOMAIN,static.cloudflareinsights.com
DOMAIN,cloudflareinsights.com

# OpenAI / ChatGPT extra CF host
DOMAIN,openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net

# Arkose / FunCaptcha (ChatGPT login & some checks)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,arkoselabs.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,funcaptcha.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,funcaptcha.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdn-arkoselabs.com
